    "quote": "The son does wrong who disobeys his father",
    "summary": "After appointing Isfendiyr as successor, Gushtsp sends him to conquer foreign kingdoms and support the religion of Zerdusht. A hostile warrior, Gurzam, accuses Isfendiyr of plotting rebellion. Gushtsp summons and imprisons his son in a mountain fort despite Isfendiyr's submission and willingness to resign his honors.",
