    "quote": "",
    "summary": "In the seventh stage of his journey, Isfendiyr leads his people toward the Brazen Fortress. A demon-guide, Kurugsar, admits that he exaggerated dangers to induce Isfendiyr to release him. Isfendiyr frees him and promises him a kingdom, but kills him after Kurugsar curses his stated intention to reach Arjsp and devastate the opposing realm. Isfendiyr then reconnoiters the fortress, which is described as an immense, inaccessible structure of iron and brass.",
    "language": "English",
    "quote_policy": "summarized"
