  "canonical_text": {
    "quote": "",
    "summary": "Drb rules benevolently, campaigns against Arabian and Macedonian forces, and secures peace with Failaks by marrying his daughter Nahd. Nahd secretly gives birth to Sikander, whose parentage and birth are concealed by Failaks. Drb also has a son, Dr, by another wife. After Drb's death, Dr rules Persia, while Sikander later becomes king of Rm and kills Dr in battle.",
