      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:10",
      "text": "The speaker describes themself as a bird of sacred gardens that has fallen into a net of chance.",
      "category": "attribute",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:11",
      "text": "The speaker says that their place was the Highest Heaven, that they were born an angel, and that they came by Adam to a cloister.",
